      "da": "Bruges i fortællinger og indirekte tale, når man ser på fremtiden set fra et tidspunkt i fortiden (»I går lovede han, at han ville ringe i morgen« – will ændres til would, og is going to ændres til was going to).",
      "en": "Used in storytelling and past reported speech to express what was still in the future from a past viewpoint (will becomes would, am/is/are going to becomes was/were going to).",
